use firn/tags

anytype is a Module
anytype is tagged notes

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.anytype.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.anytype]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."anytype"."enable": enable "Anytype — local-first knowledge/notes workspace"
